{
 "id": "11-scam-alert-gift-cards",
 "tag": "Scam Alert",
 "title": "The payment method only scammers ask for",
 "lines": [
  {
   "who": "ticker",
   "text": "If anyone asks you to pay with a gift card, stop. It's a scam.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "title",
    "headline": "Asked to pay by [gift card]? Stop.",
    "size": 108,
    "expr": "shock",
    "tk": "dock",
    "sub": "Scam Alert"
   }
  },
  {
   "who": "ticker",
   "text": "The Federal Trade Commission says it plainly: anyone who demands payment by gift card is a scammer.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "title",
    "headline": "Gift card demand = [scammer]",
    "size": 108,
    "expr": "worried",
    "tk": "dock",
    "sub": "Per the Federal Trade Commission"
   }
  },
  {
   "who": "ticker",
   "text": "Watch for the three red flags.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "list",
    "group": "l",
    "title": "The 3 red flags",
    "items": [
     {
      "h": "[Rush]",
      "d": "\"Pay now or you'll be arrested\""
     },
     {
      "h": "[Strange payment]",
      "d": "Gift cards, wire transfers, crypto"
     },
     {
      "h": "[Secrecy]",
      "d": "\"Don't tell anyone, don't hang up\""
     }
    ],
    "reveal": 1,
    "expr": "worried",
    "tk": "dock",
    "capTop": 960
   }
  },
  {
   "who": "ticker",
   "text": "Pressure to act right now. A strange way to pay, like gift cards, wires, or crypto. And being told to keep it secret.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "list",
    "group": "l",
    "title": "The 3 red flags",
    "items": [
     {
      "h": "[Rush]",
      "d": "\"Pay now or you'll be arrested\""
     },
     {
      "h": "[Strange payment]",
      "d": "Gift cards, wire transfers, crypto"
     },
     {
      "h": "[Secrecy]",
      "d": "\"Don't tell anyone, don't hang up\""
     }
    ],
    "reveal": 3,
    "expr": "worried",
    "tk": "dock",
    "capTop": 960
   }
  },
  {
   "who": "ticker",
   "text": "Real agencies like the IRS don't call demanding gift cards.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "title",
    "headline": "The IRS doesn't want [gift cards]",
    "size": 108,
    "expr": "think",
    "tk": "dock",
    "pose": "think"
   }
  },
  {
   "who": "ticker",
   "text": "So hang up, call the company back using a number you look up yourself, and report it at report fraud dot f t c dot gov.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "steps",
    "group": "w",
    "title": "What to do",
    "items": [
     {
      "h": "Hang up",
      "d": "Don't argue, don't pay"
     },
     {
      "h": "Call back [yourself]",
      "d": "Use a number you look up"
     },
     {
      "h": "Report it",
      "d": "ReportFraud.ftc.gov"
     }
    ],
    "reveal": 3,
    "expr": "up",
    "tk": "dock",
    "capTop": 960
   }
  },
  {
   "who": "ticker",
   "text": "That's the money. See you at the next bell.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "outro",
    "expr": "wink",
    "pose": "present",
    "tk": "big",
    "nocap": true,
    "cta": "Share this with someone you love"
   }
  }
 ]
